            "type": "template",
            "shape": "emanation",
            "size": 30
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " of the Risen Nemesis must attempt a "
          },
          {
            "type": "check",
            "statistic": "save:will",
            "dc": 42
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " save. Regardless of the outcome, the PCs become temporarily immune to this ability for 24 hours. On failure, the PCs are "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "b374c4c9-d230-5167-8878-38e08932a071"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " by invisible chains of guilt that only they can see (Escape). On a critical failure, the PC is also "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "13584c6a-a624-511c-a5de-0c36a9136b9e",
            "label": "Slowed 1"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " for 1 minute as they hesitate from a guilty conscience."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
